# Known Limitations

- Windows code signing is not configured yet; unsigned installers may trigger Defender or SmartScreen warnings.
- Auto-update transport is not integrated yet; update channels are architecture placeholders.
- License and entitlement systems are local architecture only; no payment provider is connected.
- Fresh-machine packaging validation still requires a clean Windows VM pass.
- Production icon `.ico` should be replaced with final signed brand artwork before public launch.
